abstract: >-
  Machine-checked Lean 4 formalizations (over Mathlib) of the improved
  sunflower bounds — Alweiss–Lovett–Wu–Zhang (STOC 2020), Rao's Coding for
  Sunflowers, and the Bell–Chueluecha–Warnke (C·r·log w)^w improvement —
  through the ALWZ and Rao–BCW approaches, together with lower bounds for
  robust-sunflower thresholds, the BCW satisfying/spread condition, and the
  classical Erdős–Rado theorem. The sources are sorry-free, with an included
  checks file verifying that the flagship theorems depend on exactly
  [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound].
